71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3s3gkm_22GsQ7kNvwGivc62&_nc_oc=AdqlUMlxBYYCBGva2PZRcgXOUX_K0yrMfHvSl3ReVZ3yW_pp4FrQky5GF6PLnEQ-zCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBgywJH06Ka-I1xiHNXBcCSGuuoaRRCEiuvuRb774kRHQ&oe=6A5A29B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cAfEECFDB3kQ7kNvwF6CZ9C&_nc_oc=Adpfh5o4JQ9ZwG_kmfXFYMfaDo2VzTNsQVEoIMQ7_aO7M9Zsp1kUDqI16cXbIE8_O2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCBwiTkli_4NJ-nEUxW94tGKFcwt1qrGVTz21L76FgJgA&oe=6A5A3C93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r3_O5Q5vJAAQ7kNvwHswQr2&_nc_oc=AdqMZeUK4EExovZ1sYmd8c5cCyBOL3dbATVGDjIMqbHtB_73NeZgr1g6gLI8504BkHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDY6C5POcJ1rW6k3kYnTLrrIs6Z5IoowWZOOjgIP21q1Q&oe=6A5A3ADA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: